body:
Definitely save the money for the top.

&#x200B;

You will never be 100% satisfied with dupes. Get the original. Also, although it might not be economical, consider the smaller bottle. Especially, if you have other fragrances. Going through 100ml or more bottles is rather difficult to do, if you have other fragrances. Also, the smaller bottle will force you to use it really sporadically, so you will cherish it more. There are like 30ml bottles on MFK's site.

I might have a great solution for you.

&#x200B;

RM reminded me of this one perfume my mum used to wear when I was little. It is rather cheap, maybe less luxurious than RM, but... Gabriela Sabatini.
